(7193081, 1106411, 174860, '<td valign="top">Nice use of selective colouring. Would be cool if the lights (or one light) was in red, too.</td>', 'Nice use of selective colouring. Would be cool if the lights (or one light) was in red, too.', '2014-03-23 21:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7193082, 1106063, 174860, '<td valign="top">Beautiful light and low POV.</td>', 'Beautiful light and low POV.', '2014-03-23 21:29:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7193139, 1106411, 20679, '<td valign="top">The selective color works well here</td>', 'The selective color works well here', '2014-03-23 23:49:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7193141, 1105957, 20679, '<td valign="top">Just a little too much detail extraction on the sky for my taste but a beautiful scene. Canadian Pacific?</td>', 'Just a little too much detail extraction on the sky for my taste but a beautiful scene. Canadian Pacific?', '2014-03-23 23:51:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7193143, 1106246, 20679, '<td valign="top">Fascinating patterns and good balance</td>', 'Fascinating patterns and good balance', '2014-03-23 23:54:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7193144, 1106177, 20679, '<td valign="top">I think the HDR treatment works well here</td>', 'I think the HDR treatment works well here', '2014-03-23 23:54:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7193145, 1106218, 20679, '<td valign="top">Love this. One of my favorites - the B&amp;W tonality is exquisite and I even like the frame</td>', 'Love this. One of my favorites - the B&W tonality is exquisite and I even like the frame', '2014-03-23 23:55:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7193146, 1106297, 20679, '<td valign="top">Great depth of field and perspective. The low angle works well and it is a very nice B&amp;W conversion</td>', 'Great depth of field and perspective. The low angle works well and it is a very nice B&W conversion', '2014-03-23 23:56:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7193147, 1106089, 20679, '<td valign="top">Love the tones in this. The sepia works very well in creating a yesteryear kind of effect</td>', 'Love the tones in this. The sepia works very well in creating a yesteryear kind of effect', '2014-03-23 23:57:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7193180, 1106417, 3724, '<td valign="top">"halp halp halp!!!"</td>', '"halp halp halp!!!"', '2014-03-24 01:20:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7193399, 1106192, 173844, '<td valign="top">Lovely rhythm of tracks framed within industrial buildings.  The mood seems somehow charged with its vapor and reddish coloration. The modest depth of focus is very effective.  A very handsome picture.  I also like that green note in the mid-lower left.</td>', 'Lovely rhythm of tracks framed within industrial buildings.  The mood seems somehow charged with its vapor and reddish coloration. The modest depth of focus is very effective.  A very handsome picture.  I also like that green note in the mid-lower left.', '2014-03-24 15:10:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7193407, 1106177, 173844, '<td valign="top">Very effective centered composition of this massive, rusting and stolid railroad car with a sense of dignity. The HDR effect is rather strong, but maybe the ominous weather atmosphere can carry it.  The train and building corner to the right nicely ground the image and avoid over-isolation.  A strong portrait.</td>', 'Very effective centered composition of this massive, rusting and stolid railroad car with a sense of dignity. The HDR effect is rather strong, but maybe the ominous weather atmosphere can carry it.  The train and building corner to the right nicely ground the image and avoid over-isolation.  A strong portrait.', '2014-03-24 15:27:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7193415, 1106405, 173844, '<td valign="top">A compelling image of foreground pattern and texture, triangular shape of railroad lines convergence and a compressed horizon of land on the other side of the road, mountains and sky.  The overall magenta cast works pretty well.  Great use of a wide angle lens.  A formidable handling of the entire scene.</td>', 'A compelling image of foreground pattern and texture, triangular shape of railroad lines convergence and a compressed horizon of land on the other side of the road, mountains and sky.  The overall magenta cast works pretty well.  Great use of a wide angle lens.  A formidable handling of the entire scene.', '2014-03-24 15:48:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7193417, 1105972, 173844, '<td valign="top">An elegant and clean image that would made an excellent poster for rail travel.  Has a great art deco feel.  The gold and blue palette and crisp composition is a tour de force.</td>', 'An elegant and clean image that would made an excellent poster for rail travel.  Has a great art deco feel.  The gold and blue palette and crisp composition is a tour de force.', '2014-03-24 15:54:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7193418, 1106400, 173844, '<td valign="top">A classic presentation that hits all the right notes.  Well done.</td>', 'A classic presentation that hits all the right notes.  Well done.', '2014-03-24 15:55:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7193419, 1105952, 173844, '<td valign="top">A very strong image with that diesel freight, beautifully lit in the twilight or dawn, coming down high-lit, serpentine tracks.  Transcendent.  The telephone lines, fence line and undulating road further the rhythm.</td>', 'A very strong image with that diesel freight, beautifully lit in the twilight or dawn, coming down high-lit, serpentine tracks.  Transcendent.  The telephone lines, fence line and undulating road further the rhythm.', '2014-03-24 16:04:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7193427, 1106199, 173844, '<td valign="top">Somewhere out west under a wild sky still reside the remnants of a storied past, and this is an excellent evocation of what once was.  The dryness and wide open spaces are here too.  Also quiet.  I like everything about this picture, but think a less centered composition would work better.</td>', 'Somewhere out west under a wild sky still reside the remnants of a storied past, and this is an excellent evocation of what once was.  The dryness and wide open spaces are here too.  Also quiet.  I like everything about this picture, but think a less centered composition would work better.', '2014-03-24 16:17:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7193430, 1105957, 173844, '<td valign="top">Beautiful setting and a fine handling of the tracks converging around the curve.  Very finely balanced composition.</td>', 'Beautiful setting and a fine handling of the tracks converging around the curve.  Very finely balanced composition.', '2014-03-24 16:23:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7193523, 1106328, 22970, '<td valign="top">Love the High Key and nicely balanced.</td>', 'Love the High Key and nicely balanced.', '2014-03-24 18:06:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7193524, 1105952, 22970, '<td valign="top">Great time of the day to take this photograph. Great leading lines.</td>', 'Great time of the day to take this photograph. Great leading lines.', '2014-03-24 18:07:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7193526, 1105957, 22970, '<td valign="top">Great photograph. I like your take on the challenge. The rails leads my eyes to a wonderful landscape. My fav of the challenge.</td>', 'Great photograph. I like your take on the challenge. The rails leads my eyes to a wonderful landscape. My fav of the challenge.', '2014-03-24 18:09:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7193527, 1106314, 22970, '<td valign="top">Very interesting and nicely done.</td>', 'Very interesting and nicely done.', '2014-03-24 18:09:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7193529, 1106246, 22970, '<td valign="top">Odd POV but works real well. Nice.</td>', 'Odd POV but works real well. Nice.', '2014-03-24 18:11:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7193530, 1106339, 22970, '<td valign="top">Interesting and I like that you achieved a wide range of focus. Nice photograph.</td>', 'Interesting and I like that you achieved a wide range of focus. Nice photograph.', '2014-03-24 18:13:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7193531, 1105972, 22970, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast between warm and cool colors. Appealing to the eye. Nice.</td>', 'Nice contrast between warm and cool colors. Appealing to the eye. Nice.', '2014-03-24 18:14:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7193532, 1105935, 22970, '<td valign="top">Nice motion photo would have like to have seen some human interaction within the photo. Nice color and lighting. Above average 6.</td>', 'Nice motion photo would have like to have seen some human interaction within the photo. Nice color and lighting. Above average 6.', '2014-03-24 18:16:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7193533, 1106089, 22970, '<td valign="top">Dreamy, interesting, nice tone. I like it! bump up.</td>', 'Dreamy, interesting, nice tone. I like it! bump up.', '2014-03-24 18:17:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7193534, 1106230, 22970, '<td valign="top">Good lighting, color, and detail. Above average. Nice.</td>', 'Good lighting, color, and detail. Above average. Nice.', '2014-03-24 18:18:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7193535, 1106328, 57447, '<td valign="top">Nice processing.</td>', 'Nice processing.', '2014-03-24 18:25:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7193559, 1106192, 127021, '<td valign="top">I like the processing and the DOF here; the composition works really well too, surprisingly.  One of my top picks.</td>', 'I like the processing and the DOF here; the composition works really well too, surprisingly.  One of my top picks.', '2014-03-24 19:18:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7193560, 1106406, 127021, '<td valign="top">excellent composition and great motion blur.  the gritty black and white combined with the details of the wires etc. really mix together well.  One of my top 3</td>', 'excellent composition and great motion blur.  the gritty black and white combined with the details of the wires etc. really mix together well.  One of my top 3', '2014-03-24 19:19:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7193561, 1105935, 127021, '<td valign="top">I really like the colors here, and the slight blur helps a lot to give a more abstract feel.  Great job</td>', 'I really like the colors here, and the slight blur helps a lot to give a more abstract feel.  Great job', '2014-03-24 19:19:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7193562, 1106319, 127021, '<td valign="top">simple, and concise.  excellent work.  top 3 for me</td>', 'simple, and concise.  excellent work.  top 3 for me', '2014-03-24 19:20:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7193563, 1105957, 127021, '<td valign="top">the technical aspect of this image is superb, so compliments for that.  in my top five.  it looks to have a  slight vignette which, i think, would be better left out or cancelled out in post.</td>', 'the technical aspect of this image is superb, so compliments for that.  in my top five.  it looks to have a  slight vignette which, i think, would be better left out or cancelled out in post.', '2014-03-24 19:21:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7193571, 1105830, 173844, '<td valign="top">More than merely a pleasing pattern of branching lines, this image hints at the joy of adventure as the lines curve into the unknown past cliff and hillside.  This promise of discovery is at the base of the allure of rail travel and its wide appeal.  And this lovely black and white evocation of these longed for moments is captured here with a low, intimate perspective that invites the viewer into the scene.  On a personal note, it brings back wonderful memories of the summer I once spent hopping freight trains across the country.</td>', 'More than merely a pleasing pattern of branching lines, this image hints at the joy of adventure as the lines curve into the unknown past cliff and hillside.  This promise of discovery is at the base of the allure of rail travel and its wide appeal.  And this lovely black and white evocation of these longed for moments is captured here with a low, intimate perspective that invites the viewer into the scene.  On a personal note, it brings back wonderful memories of the summer I once spent hopping freight trains across the country.', '2014-03-24 20:01:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7193587, 1105952, 57447, '<td valign="top">Nice light on the tracks.</td>', 'Nice light on the tracks.', '2014-03-24 20:45:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7193588, 1106089, 57447, '<td valign="top">Well done!</td>', 'Well done!', '2014-03-24 20:46:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7193599, 1106174, 173844, '<td valign="top">I like the feeling of anticipation here with the close focus on the rail and the train bearing down.</td>', 'I like the feeling of anticipation here with the close focus on the rail and the train bearing down.', '2014-03-24 21:26:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7193602, 1106367, 173844, '<td valign="top">Even though this image is in color, it nicely approximates a black and white with its emphasis on crows, the tanker car and the snow.</td>', 'Even though this image is in color, it nicely approximates a black and white with its emphasis on crows, the tanker car and the snow.', '2014-03-24 21:35:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7193604, 1105986, 173844, '<td valign="top">A bold and interesting study of textures and weathering.  Very nice.</td>', 'A bold and interesting study of textures and weathering.  Very nice.', '2014-03-24 21:39:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7193606, 1106030, 173844, '<td valign="top">Well-balanced and delicate composition.  Fascinating interplay of curves and lines.</td>', 'Well-balanced and delicate composition.  Fascinating interplay of curves and lines.', '2014-03-24 21:42:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7193608, 1106417, 173844, '<td valign="top">I''m not quite clear what this has to do with trains, but I like this picture very much.</td>', 'I''m not quite clear what this has to do with trains, but I like this picture very much.', '2014-03-24 21:43:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7193611, 1106230, 173844, '<td valign="top">Handsome picture of a grand old train.  Nice detail.</td>', 'Handsome picture of a grand old train.  Nice detail.', '2014-03-24 21:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7193614, 1106413, 173844, '<td valign="top">Nice black and white of this fallen dinosaur.</td>', 'Nice black and white of this fallen dinosaur.', '2014-03-24 21:49:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7193616, 1106210, 173844, '<td valign="top">Nice deep image following the lines as far as you can.</td>', 'Nice deep image following the lines as far as you can.', '2014-03-24 21:51:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7193618, 1106086, 173844, '<td valign="top">Very nice image.</td>', 'Very nice image.', '2014-03-24 21:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7193726, 1106158, 11769, '<td valign="top">wonderful shot</td>', 'wonderful shot', '2014-03-25 07:56:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7193727, 1106406, 11769, '<td valign="top">yes, please do</td>', 'yes, please do', '2014-03-25 07:59:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7193728, 1106242, 11769, '<td valign="top">beautifully out of focus</td>', 'beautifully out of focus', '2014-03-25 08:00:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7193729, 1106375, 11769, '<td valign="top">nice light</td>', 'nice light', '2014-03-25 08:01:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7193749, 1106339, 163430, '<td valign="top">I had a similar idea, but didn''t manage to get a photographing permit from the railways authorities on time. My asking nicely approach was rejected nicely :-) "You really need a permit, a you will surely get one if you stop by the central office on Monday". My kit lens is not long enough for shooting from a distance.</td>', 'I had a similar idea, but didn''t manage to get a photographing permit from the railways authorities on time. My asking nicely approach was rejected nicely :-) "You really need a permit, a you will surely get one if you stop by the central office on Monday". My kit lens is not long enough for shooting from a distance.', '2014-03-25 09:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7193761, 1106203, 173844, '<td valign="top">A fine, cheery picture, but in my humble opinion a strong focus on the rusted wheels would yield a more interesting study.  Perhaps a shot from below contrasting with the vivid sky?  Just a suggestion, I don''t know if that would even be possible.</td>', 'A fine, cheery picture, but in my humble opinion a strong focus on the rusted wheels would yield a more interesting study.  Perhaps a shot from below contrasting with the vivid sky?  Just a suggestion, I don''t know if that would even be possible.', '2014-03-25 10:06:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7193772, 1105898, 144271, '<td valign="top">Great old train</td>', 'Great old train', '2014-03-25 10:46:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7193773, 1106063, 144271, '<td valign="top">Beautiful light on the tracks.</td>', 'Beautiful light on the tracks.', '2014-03-25 10:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7193774, 1105957, 144271, '<td valign="top">What a wonderful view</td>', 'What a wonderful view', '2014-03-25 10:47:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7193795, 1106417, 118154, '<td valign="top">Not sure about your train of thought.</td>', 'Not sure about your train of thought.', '2014-03-25 12:07:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7193796, 1106246, 118154, '<td valign="top">Nice image.</td>', 'Nice image.', '2014-03-25 12:08:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7193797, 1106192, 118154, '<td valign="top">I really like this.</td>', 'I really like this.', '2014-03-25 12:08:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7193811, 1106218, 129147, '<td valign="top">Processing rocks! I guess that I''m looking at train "parts" but really enjoy what you did here.</td>', 'Processing rocks! I guess that I''m looking at train "parts" but really enjoy what you did here.', '2014-03-25 12:59:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7193812, 1106328, 129147, '<td valign="top">Enjoy this and hope it does well. Like that you didn''t crop the top.</td>', 'Enjoy this and hope it does well. Like that you didn''t crop the top.', '2014-03-25 13:00:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7193813, 1106332, 129147, '<td valign="top">This is pretty cool. Don''t know if the shadow adds or distracts. Interesting crop as well.</td>', 'This is pretty cool. Don''t know if the shadow adds or distracts. Interesting crop as well.', '2014-03-25 13:00:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7193815, 1106337, 129147, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t do much for me.</td>', 'Doesn''t do much for me.', '2014-03-25 13:00:59.000000', NULL, 1),
