(7194343, 1106299, 68504, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by streetpigeon:</b></div><hr/><i> A veritable symphony of rail lines overlaid with a scratchy counterpoint of towers and wires.  And then there''s the staccato of the signal lights, to extend the metaphor.  All this busy detail is wonderfully captured at a perfect time of day.  I find it moving. </i></td></tr></table> can''t say it any better.</td>', 'Originally posted by streetpigeon: A veritable symphony of rail lines overlaid with a scratchy counterpoint of towers and wires.  And then there''s the staccato of the signal lights, to extend the metaphor.  All this busy detail is wonderfully captured at a perfect time of day.  I find it moving.  can''t say it any better.', '2014-03-26 13:13:31.000000', NULL, 0),
